   The ServerKeyExchange message is extended as follows.

           enum {
               ec_diffie_hellman
           } KeyExchangeAlgorithm;

   o  ec_diffie_hellman: Indicates the ServerKeyExchange message
      contains an ECDH public key.

      select (KeyExchangeAlgorithm) {
